+## MODIFIED Requirements
+
+### Requirement: Default template autoescaping
+Flask SHALL enable Jinja autoescaping when no template filename is supplied or when a template filename ends with `.html`, `.htm`, `.xml`, `.xhtml`, or `.svg`, regardless of the suffix's letter case. Flask SHALL disable default autoescaping for filenames without one of those suffixes.
+
+#### Scenario: Mixed-case supported suffix
+- WHEN the default selector receives `invoice.HTML` or `diagram.SvG`
+- THEN it enables autoescaping.
+
+#### Scenario: Unsupported filename
+- WHEN the default selector receives `invoice.txt`
+- THEN it disables autoescaping.
